  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-04-29",
   "text": "Community Broadband Act of 2021\n This bill prohibits states from blocking the provision of broadband by public providers, public-private partnership providers, or cooperatively organized providers. Further, public providers and state or local entities participating in a partnership must administer applicable ordinances and rules without discrimination against competing private providers."
  }
